{
  "id": "webhook",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "kernelCompat": "^0.3.0",
  "description": "本机 HTTP webhook：让 CI / Git 平台 / 监控 / Zapier、n8n / 脚本 / 手机快捷指令用一个 POST 把 agent 叫醒——按 prompt 模板（{{body}} / {{json.a.b}} / {{header.x}} / {{query.k}}）渲染请求后作为一句用户输入投递给 agent 会话；默认只监听 127.0.0.1，token 在 URL 里只给一次；只是叫醒不是后台执行，内核不在时回 503。",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "install": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/theyuyan/cak-plugins.git",
    "ref": "main",
    "subdir": "plugins/webhook"
  },
  "entrypoint": {
    "type": "subprocess",
    "command": "node",
    "args": [
      "dist/main.js"
    ]
  },
  "contracts": [
    {
      "name": "webhook.list",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "sampleArgs": {}
    },
    {
      "name": "webhook.create",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "sampleArgs": {
        "name": "conformance-test",
        "prompt": "收到：{{body}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "webhook.delete",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "sampleArgs": {
        "name": "nonexistent"
      }
    }
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "webhook",
    "回调",
    "HTTP",
    "POST",
    "叫醒",
    "触发",
    "事件",
    "CI",
    "告警",
    "监控",
    "快捷指令",
    "n8n",
    "zapier",
    "trigger",
    "callback",
    "event",
    "wake"
  ],
  "setup": "无需配置；数据存 ~/.cak/webhook/hooks.json（WEBHOOK_DIR 可改），端口首次随机 40000-49999 或 WEBHOOK_PORT；默认只监听 127.0.0.1（WEBHOOK_BIND=0.0.0.0 才对外，要放反代/防火墙后）。",
  "source": "https://github.com/theyuyan/cak-plugins/tree/main/plugins/webhook",
  "tier": "T1"
}
